---
import CompliantLayout from '@/layouts/CompliantLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '@/components/PageIntro.astro';
---

<CompliantLayout title="Partner Disclosure" sectionAds="legal">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Transparency" title="Partner disclosure" description="How affiliate links work on KitchenWise — and what we will not do for money." />

  <section class="max-w-site mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-14">
    <article class="content-panel max-w-prose mx-auto prose prose-lg prose-ink">
      <p class="!mt-0">
        We may earn a commission from links on this site. It never changes our picks.
      </p>
      <p>
        KitchenWise is independent. Some of the product links we publish are
        affiliate links: if you click one and buy, the retailer may pay us a
        small commission. It costs you nothing — the price you pay is the same
        whether you use our link or not.
      </p>
      <p>
        We also work with a small number of retailer partner programs
        (brand-direct and network programs). Commission rates vary by retailer
        and product; our ranking, testing notes and recommendations are written
        before we check whether a product has a program at all.
      </p>
      <p>
        What we will not do: we do not accept payment to recommend a product,
        we do not publish paid placements, sponsored posts or brand
        sponsorships, and we do not hide a commercial relationship. If a page
        ever contains a paid partnership, it will say so plainly at the top.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have questions about any specific recommendation, please
        reach out: <a href="mailto:hello@kitchenwise.app">hello@kitchenwise.app</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</CompliantLayout>
